  "details": "I would love to see a Trail Pen added as an official Item in VRChat.\n\nWith the new Items system, a Trail Pen would let users draw lines, shapes, or even write text directly in the world. This would not only be fun and creative, but also provide a highly practical tool for communication.\n\nWhy this matters:\n\nConsistency across worlds\n\nCurrently, pens or markers only exist in certain worlds. If you want to communicate by drawing or writing, you have to hope the world creator included one. An official Trail Pen Item would solve this by making it available anywhere, anytime, enabling reliable text-based communication (筆談) between users.\n\nBetter usability through the Items system\n\nSome users currently rely on avatar-based pens, but those are limited: you need to switch avatars, and not everyone can use them easily. With the new Items system and its intuitive Use interaction, a Trail Pen would be much easier and more universal, since anyone could pick it up and start drawing immediately.\n\nA practical demonstration of Items\n\nPrevious official Items have been mostly playful or decorative. A Trail Pen, however, would show users how Items can provide practical, functional tools. This makes it easier for the community to imagine new possibilities and future use cases of the Items system.\n\nPotential uses:\n\nReal-time explanation and teaching (sketching ideas, diagrams, etc.)\n\nFun doodling or collaborative drawing with friends\n\nNon-verbal communication and accessibility support\n\nAdding an engaging, interactive layer to hangouts and social activities\n\nFor these reasons, I believe a Trail Pen would be an excellent candidate for one of the first official Items in VRChat. It would highlight the flexibility of the new Items system while offering a practical, creative tool that many users could benefit from.\n\nPlease consider adding a Trail Pen as an official Item",
